  ('eeeeeeee-eeee-4eee-8eee-000000000015',NULL,'bbbbbbbb-bbbb-4bbb-8bbb-000000000005','paragraph','{"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "计划文本里回购价格那条写得很含糊，只说\"按公司届时确定的价格\"。当时没细看。"}}]}',0,0,5,'2026-02-14T21:05:00.000Z','2026-06-07T22:40:00.000Z'),
  ('eeeeeeee-eeee-4eee-8eee-000000000016',NULL,'bbbbbbbb-bbbb-4bbb-8bbb-000000000005','paragraph','{"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "要弄清楚的是：已经归属的部分，公司能不能按自己定的价收回去。"}}]}',0,0,6,'2026-02-14T21:05:00.000Z','2026-06-07T22:40:00.000Z'),
