  ('eeeeeeee-eeee-4eee-8eee-000000000026',NULL,'bbbbbbbb-bbbb-4bbb-8bbb-000000000007','paragraph','{"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "孩子出生后开支会涨一截。过渡期要留够几个月的缓冲，不能为了快点拿到钱就随便签字。"}}]}',0,0,5,'2026-03-08T15:20:00.000Z','2026-06-03T21:15:00.000Z'),
  ('eeeeeeee-eeee-4eee-8eee-000000000027',NULL,'bbbbbbbb-bbbb-4bbb-8bbb-000000000008','heading_2','{"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "踩过的坑"}}]}',0,0,1,'2026-04-26T14:33:00.000Z','2026-05-18T11:20:00.000Z'),
  ('eeeeeeee-eeee-4eee-8eee-000000000028',NULL,'bbbbbbbb-bbbb-4bbb-8bbb-000000000008','paragraph','{"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "对账任务原来跑三个小时，全表扫。加了按 posted_at 的分区、批次从五万降到两万，二十二分钟结束。"}}]}',0,0,2,'2026-04-26T14:33:00.000Z','2026-05-18T11:20:00.000Z'),
  ('eeeeeeee-eeee-4eee-8eee-000000000029',NULL,'bbbbbbbb-bbbb-4bbb-8bbb-000000000008','paragraph','{"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "灰度开关要留，回滚路径必须提前验证过一次，不能只写在文档里。"}}]}',0,0,3,'2026-04-26T14:33:00.000Z','2026-05-18T11:20:00.000Z'),
  ('eeeeeeee-eeee-4eee-8eee-000000000030',NULL,'bbbbbbbb-bbbb-4bbb-8bbb-000000000009','heading_2','{"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "我的定位"}}]}',0,0,1,'2026-05-24T22:10:00.000Z','2026-06-07T23:05:00.000Z'),
  ('eeeeeeee-eeee-4eee-8eee-000000000031',NULL,'bbbbbbbb-bbbb-4bbb-8bbb-000000000009','bulleted_list_item','{"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "方向：后端 / 平台，Java 和 Go 都能写，分布式是主线"}}]}',0,0,2,'2026-05-24T22:10:00.000Z','2026-06-07T23:05:00.000Z'),
  ('eeeeeeee-eeee-4eee-8eee-000000000032',NULL,'bbbbbbbb-bbbb-4bbb-8bbb-000000000009','bulleted_list_item','{"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "城市：上海，老婆孕期，异地不考虑"}}]}',0,0,3,'2026-05-24T22:10:00.000Z','2026-06-07T23:05:00.000Z'),
  ('eeeeeeee-eeee-4eee-8eee-000000000033',NULL,'bbbbbbbb-bbbb-4bbb-8bbb-000000000009','bulleted_list_item','{"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "偏好：稳定的正编岗位，平台型业务"}}]}',0,0,4,'2026-05-24T22:10:00.000Z','2026-06-07T23:05:00.000Z'),
  ('eeeeeeee-eeee-4eee-8eee-000000000034',NULL,'bbbbbbbb-bbbb-4bbb-8bbb-000000000009','heading_2','{"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "红线"}}]}',0,0,5,'2026-05-24T22:10:00.000Z','2026-06-07T23:05:00.000Z'),
  ('eeeeeeee-eeee-4eee-8eee-000000000035',NULL,'bbbbbbbb-bbbb-4bbb-8bbb-000000000009','paragraph','{"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "外包、人力派遣、驻场这类一律不去，工资再高也不去。上一次就是这么被动的。"}}]}',0,0,6,'2026-05-24T22:10:00.000Z','2026-06-07T23:05:00.000Z'),
  ('eeeeeeee-eeee-4eee-8eee-000000000036',NULL,'bbbbbbbb-bbbb-4bbb-8bbb-000000000010','to_do','{"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "把分库分表收尾的量化结果写进去（未完成）"}}]}',0,0,1,'2026-06-02T23:20:00.000Z','2026-06-07T21:40:00.000Z'),
  ('eeeeeeee-eeee-4eee-8eee-000000000037',NULL,'bbbbbbbb-bbbb-4bbb-8bbb-000000000010','to_do','{"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "对账任务三小时降到二十二分钟这条要突出（未完成）"}}]}',0,0,2,'2026-06-02T23:20:00.000Z','2026-06-07T21:40:00.000Z'),
  ('eeeeeeee-eeee-4eee-8eee-000000000038',NULL,'bbbbbbbb-bbbb-4bbb-8bbb-000000000010','to_do','{"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "带过五人小组的经历补上（未完成）"}}]}',0,0,3,'2026-06-02T23:20:00.000Z','2026-06-07T21:40:00.000Z'),
  ('eeeeeeee-eeee-4eee-8eee-000000000039',NULL,'bbbbbbbb-bbbb-4bbb-8bbb-000000000010','paragraph','{"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "投递的时候别用一个模板群发，每家的 JD 要点不一样。"}}]}',0,0,4,'2026-06-02T23:20:00.000Z','2026-06-07T21:40:00.000Z'),
  ('eeeeeeee-eeee-4eee-8eee-000000000040',NULL,'bbbbbbbb-bbbb-4bbb-8bbb-000000000011','paragraph','{"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "讲地方政府投融资那几章值得反复看。财政和土地的关系是理解很多事情的底层。"}}]}',0,0,1,'2025-12-19T13:43:00.000Z','2026-01-11T20:05:00.000Z'),
  ('eeeeeeee-eeee-4eee-8eee-000000000041',NULL,'bbbbbbbb-bbbb-4bbb-8bbb-000000000011','paragraph','{"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "看完想起自己买房时候的纠结，其实当时对政策周期一无所知。"}}]}',0,0,2,'2025-12-19T13:43:00.000Z','2026-01-11T20:05:00.000Z'),
  ('eeeeeeee-eeee-4eee-8eee-000000000042',NULL,'bbbbbbbb-bbbb-4bbb-8bbb-000000000012','paragraph','{"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "存量、流量、反馈回路这三个概念解释了很多线上事故的成因。"}}]}',0,0,1,'2025-10-06T23:23:00.000Z','2025-10-27T17:07:00.000Z'),
  ('eeeeeeee-eeee-4eee-8eee-000000000043',NULL,'bbbbbbbb-bbbb-4bbb-8bbb-000000000012','paragraph','{"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "延迟反馈会让人做出过度调整——这点在容量规划上特别明显。"}}]}',0,0,2,'2025-10-06T23:23:00.000Z','2025-10-27T17:07:00.000Z'),
  ('eeeeeeee-eeee-4eee-8eee-000000000044',NULL,'bbbbbbbb-bbbb-4bbb-8bbb-000000000013','heading_2','{"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "体检与作息"}}]}',0,0,1,'2026-01-04T12:27:00.000Z','2026-05-30T08:45:00.000Z'),
  ('eeeeeeee-eeee-4eee-8eee-000000000045',NULL,'bbbbbbbb-bbbb-4bbb-8bbb-000000000013','bulleted_list_item','{"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "2026-01 体检：尿酸偏高，其余正常"}}]}',0,0,2,'2026-01-04T12:27:00.000Z','2026-05-30T08:45:00.000Z'),
  ('eeeeeeee-eeee-4eee-8eee-000000000046',NULL,'bbbbbbbb-bbbb-4bbb-8bbb-000000000013','bulleted_list_item','{"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "医生建议少喝含糖饮料、控制夜宵"}}]}',0,0,3,'2026-01-04T12:27:00.000Z','2026-05-30T08:45:00.000Z'),
  ('eeeeeeee-eeee-4eee-8eee-000000000047',NULL,'bbbbbbbb-bbbb-4bbb-8bbb-000000000013','paragraph','{"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "四五月项目忙，熬夜多，最近老是头疼。等这阵子过去要调整回来。"}}]}',0,0,4,'2026-01-04T12:27:00.000Z','2026-05-30T08:45:00.000Z'),
